@startuml state_assignment
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam ArrowColor #444444
skinparam BackgroundColor white
[*] --> Assigned : CreateAssignment\n(Producer)
Assigned --> InProgress : StartAssignment\n(assignee)
ReworkRequired --> InProgress : StartAssignment
Assigned --> Submitted : SubmitAssignment
InProgress --> Submitted : SubmitAssignment
Submitted --> UnderReview : OpenAssignmentReview\n(Editor)
UnderReview --> Approved : ApproveAssignment\n(Editor, not own work)
UnderReview --> ReworkRequired : RequestAssignmentChanges
Approved --> ReworkRequired : ReturnWorkFromReview /\nimpact review
InProgress --> Assigned : TransferAssignmentScope\n(new assignee)
Approved --> [*]
state Blocked #EEEEEE : declared, never set (gap G5)
@enduml
